                    "description" : "<div prod_cat_ver=2>\n    The unique ID of the <a href=\"/docs/api?prod_cat_ver=2#mbe\">business entity</a> of this subscription. This is always the same as the <a href=\"/docs/api/subscriptions?prod_cat_ver=2#subscription_customer_id\">business entity</a> of the customer.\n    <span isMicro='true' featureId='cb-mbe'></span>\n</div>\n<div prod_cat_ver=1>\n    The ID of the business entity created for the site. For Product Catalog 1.0, all the site data is tied to this business entity.\n    <div class='alert alert-info'>\n        <strong>Note</strong>\n        <p><a href=\"/docs/api?prod_cat_ver=2#mbe\">Multiple Business Entities</a> is a feature available only on Product Catalog 2.0.</p>\n    </div>\n    <span isMicro='true' featureId='cb-mbe'></span>\n</div>",
